    {
      "speaker": "甜花",
      "text": "にへへ……プロデューサーさんも、なーちゃんも一緒なら……甜花、外でもちょっとだけ頑張れる、かも……。",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "tenka",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "015",
      "clothId": "015",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "smile1",
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_05",
        "zh": "嘿嘿……只要制作人先生和甘奈酱在一起……甜花在外面也能稍微努力一下下，大概……。",
        "speakerZh": "大崎甜花",
        "surfaceEmotion": "joy_bright",
        "innerEmotion": "trust_warm",
        "vocalTone": "warm_soft",
        "note": "[小段 2: 轮流说出公演目标与欢声笑语] [镜头B] 全员轮流说出对下一次公演的目标，笑声回荡在夜空",
